{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new custom liquid block called "Nuevos productos carrusel". Display all store products sorted by newest first using collections.all.products with sort_by: created-descending. Do NOT use a collection picker.
    
    CRITICAL — HTML structure (mandatory, do not change): The carousel must use exactly 3 nested containers:
    
    outer-wrapper (overflow: visible, padding: 48px 0)
      └── clip-wrapper (overflow: hidden, margin: 0, padding: 0)
            └── scroll-container (overflow-x: auto, padding: 32px 40px, margin: -32px 0)
                  └── flex-row (display: flex, gap: 16px)
                        └── cards
    outer-wrapper: overflow: visible; width: 100%; padding: 48px 0; — allows top/bottom shadows to breathe
    clip-wrapper: overflow: hidden; width: 100%; — prevents horizontal overflow that breaks mobile viewport, contains left/right shadow clipping intentionally
    scroll-container: overflow-x: auto; padding: 32px 40px; margin: -32px 0; scrollbar-width: none; scroll-behavior: smooth; — the vertical negative margin (-32px top and bottom) restores space for top/bottom shadows without affecting horizontal layout
    flex-row: display: flex; flex-direction: row; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; gap: 16px;
    This structure is the only correct way to show vertical shadows while preventing mobile zoom-out. Do not simplify or alter it.
    
    Carousel behavior:
    
    Mobile: 2 cards visible side by side, swipe LEFT/RIGHT
    Desktop (min-width 750px): 4 cards visible
    scroll-snap-align: start on each card
    Hide scrollbar: scrollbar-width: none + ::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none }
    Image format:
    
    3:4 portrait ratio — padding-top: 133.33%, position relative container, absolute image inside
    object-fit: cover
    overflow: hidden on image container
    Border-radius from card_border_radius setting
    On hover: transform: scale(1.08) with transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)
    Ultra-premium animations:
    
    Page load — staggered entrance per card:
    
    From: opacity: 0; transform: translateY(32px) scale(0.97)
    To: opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1)
    Duration: 0.7s, easing: cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), animation-fill-mode: both
    Stagger: 100ms delay per card using nth-child loop
    Hover state:
    
    Card: transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.02)
    Background → hover_background_color
    Texts → hover_text_color
    Shadow intensifies smoothly
    All transitions: 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)
    Shadow transition declared separately: box-shadow 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)
    Active/press state:
    
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.00)
    Text: all card text always text-align: center
    
    Card sizing:
    
    Mobile: flex: 0 0 calc(45vw - 8px)
    Desktop: flex: 0 0 calc(22% - 8px)
    Theme editor settings:
    
    Heading:
    
    heading_text — text, default "Nuevos productos"
    heading_color — color picker
    heading_size — range 16–48, default 24
    heading_alignment — select left/center/right, default center
    Card texts:
    
    card_title_color — color picker
    card_title_size — range 12–24, default 14
    card_price_color — color picker
    card_price_size — range 12–22, default 14
    card_vendor_color — color picker
    show_price — checkbox, default true
    show_vendor — checkbox, default false
    Hover colors:
    
    hover_background_color — color picker, default #1a1a1a
    hover_text_color — color picker, default #ffffff
    Shadow — normal:
    
    shadow_color — color picker, default #000000
    shadow_opacity — range 0–30, default 8
    shadow_offset_x — range -20 to 20, default 0
    shadow_offset_y — range 0–30, default 6
    shadow_blur — range 0–80, default 20
    shadow_spread — range -10 to 20, default 0
    Shadow — hover:
    
    hover_shadow_opacity — range 0–40, default 20
    hover_shadow_blur — range 0–100, default 40
    hover_shadow_spread — range -10 to 20, default 4
    hover_shadow_offset_y — range 0–40, default 12
    Card layout:
    
    card_background — color picker, default #ffffff
    card_border_radius — range 0–32, default 14
    card_padding — range 8–32, default 14
    products_to_show — range 4–24, default 8
    Non-negotiable requirements:
    
    Use the exact 3-container structure described above — no simplifications
    Images always 3:4 portrait
    All text always centered
    No hardcoded colors or shadow values — all from settings
    Layout always horizontal
    All easings cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) for premium feel
    body must NOT have overflow-x: hidden added — fix must be structural, not a band-aid
    
    la tarjeta de producto debe tener la capacidad de tambien poner el precio de oferta para comparar con el precio actual, pero es importante que este precio este por debajo
    
    Al igual, quiero que arregles el margen, ya que la sombra tiene una linea blanca que lo parte y hace que se corte, corrigelo 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-new-products-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-carousel-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.heading_alignment }};
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    margin: 0 0 -20px 0;
  }

  .ai-carousel-outer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 0px 0;
  }

  .ai-carousel-clip-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow: hidden;
    width: 100%;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .ai-carousel-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    overflow-x: auto;
    padding: 52px 10px 52px 20px;
    margin: 0px 0;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
  }

  .ai-carousel-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-carousel-flex-row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: row;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex: 0 0 calc(45vw - 8px);
    scroll-snap-align: start;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), background-color 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), box-shadow 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(32px) scale(0.97);
    animation: ai-card-entrance-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
    animation-fill-mode: both;
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_x }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_y }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.shadow_spread }}px rgba({{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_extract: 'red' }}, {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_extract: 'green' }}, {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_extract: 'blue' }}, {{ block.settings.shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex: 0 0 calc(22% - 8px);
    }
  }

  .ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px) scale(1.02);
    background-color: {{ block.settings.hover_background_color }};
    box-shadow: {{ block.settings.shadow_offset_x }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_offset_y }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_blur }}px {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_spread }}px rgba({{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_extract: 'red' }}, {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_extract: 'green' }}, {{ block.settings.shadow_color | color_extract: 'blue' }}, {{ block.settings.hover_shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
  }

  .ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active {
    transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.00);
  }

  .ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-carousel-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-carousel-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-carousel-card-vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }},
  .ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-carousel-card-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.hover_text_color }};
  }

  {% for i in (1..24) %}
    .ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child({{ i }}) {
      animation-delay: {{ i | minus: 1 | times: 100 }}ms;
    }
  {% endfor %}

  @keyframes ai-card-entrance-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    0% {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(32px) scale(0.97);
    }
    100% {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
    }
  }

  .ai-carousel-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    padding-top: 133.33%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .ai-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: scale(1.08);
  }

  .ai-carousel-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_title_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size }}px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
    transition: color 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-carousel-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_price_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_price_size }}px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    transition: color 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-carousel-card-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_price_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_price_size | times: 0.85 | round }}px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 4px 0;
    text-decoration: line-through;
    opacity: 0.6;
    transition: color 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }

  .ai-carousel-card-vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.card_vendor_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_price_size | times: 0.85 | round }}px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0;
    opacity: 0.7;
    transition: color 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
  }
{% endstyle %}

<new-products-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-new-products-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% if block.settings.heading_text != blank %}
    <h2 class="ai-carousel-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading_text }}</h2>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-carousel-outer-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-carousel-clip-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-carousel-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-carousel-flex-row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% assign sorted_products = collections.all.products | sort: 'created_at' | reverse %}
          {% for product in sorted_products limit: block.settings.products_to_show %}
            <a href="{{ product.url }}" class="ai-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <div class="ai-carousel-image-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if product.featured_image %}
                  <img
                    src="{{ product.featured_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
                    alt="{{ product.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
                    class="ai-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                    width="600"
                    height="800"
                  >
                {% else %}
                  <div class="ai-carousel-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ 'product-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
              </div>

              <h3 class="ai-carousel-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.title }}</h3>

              {% if block.settings.show_price %}
                {% if product.compare_at_price > product.price %}
                  <div class="ai-carousel-card-compare-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                    {{ product.compare_at_price | money }}
                  </div>
                {% endif %}
                <div class="ai-carousel-card-price-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ product.price | money }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}

              {% if block.settings.show_vendor and product.vendor != blank %}
                <div class="ai-carousel-card-vendor-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ product.vendor }}</div>
              {% endif %}
            </a>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</new-products-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class NewProductsCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.scrollContainer = this.querySelector('.ai-carousel-scroll-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        if (this.scrollContainer) {
          this.scrollContainer.addEventListener('touchstart', this.handleTouchStart.bind(this), { passive: true });
        }
      }

      handleTouchStart(e) {
        this.scrollContainer.style.scrollSnapType = 'x mandatory';
      }
    }

    customElements.define('new-products-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}', NewProductsCarousel{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

